All regular board of commissioners meetings shall follow an established order of business. The order is as follows:
(1) Call to order;
(2) Minutes;
(3) Invited guests;
(4) Reports from committees and departments;
(5) Consent agenda;
(6) Old business;
(7) New business;
(8) Public comments;
(9) Adjournment.

