The building inspector of the county, or his or her designee (hereinafter "building inspector"), is designated and appointed to exercise the powers prescribed by the ordinances and effectuate the purposes of this article and O.C.G.A. § 41-2-7 through O.C.G.A. § 42-2-17, including the following powers in addition to others granted in O.C.G.A. § 41-2-7 through O.C.G.A. § 41-2-10 and O.C.G.A. § 41-2-12 through O.C.G.A. § 41-2-17:
